  "description": "Secure Backend-for-Frontend (BFF) authentication for .NET 8+ with self-guiding fluent builder API, complete Swagger UI integration, OAuth 2.0/OIDC support, multi-tenancy, and Keycloak integration. Features IntelliSense-driven setup with 3 flexible configuration approaches.",
